// K6 -- how far does the data actually reach? The newest Okta event the tenant
// holds, and the volume of the last day. A negative such as "no activity after
// the unlock" holds only up to `latest`, never to the end of a window that
// reaches past the time of the run (the incident +24h, for a fresh ticket).
// Counts only.
Okta
| where timestamp > ago(1d)
| summarize latest = max(timestamp), events = dcount(uuid),
    accounts = dcount(tolower(tostring(["actor.alternateId"])))
